# Two one-way blocks of Duboce run head-on into Valencia (cars from both sides turn there; one-way
# streets drive the centre line). The first car from each side stopped nose to nose for good and
# the street behind them jammed: the rider line valencia_north crawled behind five stopped cars
# (city phase 10, when the bigger street network reshuffled the random traffic). An oncoming car
# is the car ahead for only one of the two: the older goes first, the other waits, both drive on.
park sf
spawn park_gate
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 2 car -57 -79.8 270 8
cmd 2 car -84 -83 90 8
run 720
expect car.car.speed > 1 at 360
expect car.car.speed > 1 at 720
